        <mxCell id="pvZ-KqbLqHoGzjqvof50-208" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;这里一个work cycle对标lead agent的一个user turn。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot; color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;agent step开始会handle_inbox_message，然后&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;LLM request，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;LLM respond，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;tool execute。一个&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;agent step&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;结束标志是&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;LLM respond/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;tool execute&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;work cycle会循环&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;agent step直到一个&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;agent step&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;不调用工具，然后&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;执行idle_poll(会&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;handle_inbox_message&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;)。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;一个&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;work cycle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;结束标志是&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;执行完idle_poll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;teammate run会&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;循环&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;work cycle直到&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;work cycle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;执行完idle_poll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;时inbox读到shut_down或者超时没领到任务，然后summary，一个&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;teammate run&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;结束标志是&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;执行完&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;summary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rotation=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
